  "details": "1. Join [2018 Home](https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_a0ad5ad3-2b2c-4a77-8220-d372d299b412/info) (`wrld_a0ad5ad3-2b2c-4a77-8220-d372d299b412`) by vrchat (private and only visible via direct links)\n\n2. Try to interact with the Help Videos player or observe the Quest Log.\n\nExpected behavior: Use the buttons to choose Help Videos, maybe watch them. Maybe unlock features with 5 friends, 3 favorite worlds, 2 favorite avatars.\n\nActual behavior: The buttons for Help Videos are broken and even the default Safety video can't be watched. Quest Logs is also non-functional.\n\nAdditional information: The world was last updated on Dec 28 2018. Built with Unity 2017.4.15f1.",
